    "body": "claimed: Codex (m3) · 2026-11-25T04:43Z · branch mkinney:issue/3333-sinker-start-exit · plan: the Sinker Burn reads the start pick as the start angle of its orbit and the exit pick as the angle where the orbit ends; the Sinker Side Burn reads each pick as an end of its side move; an impossible pick is refused by name; no pick keeps each path byte-identical.\n\n@NeoTech: this is yours to take back at any time - say so here and we stop.\n",
